  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Supabase via the PostgREST REST API. Uses Supabase's auto-generated REST interface to store OASIS holons and avatars in PostgreSQL. No Supabase SDK required — uses System.Net.Http. Compatible with Supabase cloud and self-hosted instances. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
