  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.SupabaseOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConnects the OASIS to Supabase via the PostgREST REST API. Uses Supabase's auto-generated REST interface to store OASIS holons and avatars in PostgreSQL. No Supabase SDK required — uses System.Net.Http. Compatible with Supabase cloud and self-hosted instances. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- Integrate restricted Supabase WEB4 reader and Core query admission (55388fd)\n- Integrate verified native Supabase PostgREST storage (754644b)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Recover Supabase bounded CQL demo and record successful hosted release (f314c22)\n- Validate GUID native keys before avatar deletion in forty adapters (597758b)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Cloud/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.SupabaseOASIS",
